From 55853e9a22e17759afde993926c4402067fd6d69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:48:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] samples: hbf: add hbfctl CLI tool and bpftrace
 observability scripts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

hbfctl CLI tool with subcommands:
  submit  <addr> <len> -o <op> -n <nid> [-d deadline_ns] [-t tag]
  query   <request_id>
  cancel  <request_id>
  caps
  status  (reads debugfs stats)

bpftrace-based observability tools:
  hbf_latency.py       — submission-to-completion latency histograms
  hbf_migrations.py    — per-node page migration counts and bandwidth
  hbf_deadline_misses.py — deadline overrun distribution

These scripts produce histograms from the hbf tracepoints for offline
analysis.

Signed-off-by: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
